# anthropic_federation_issuer (Data Source)

Fetches a Workload Identity Federation issuer by ID, including its JWKS configuration and JWKS polling status.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/federation_issuers/{id}`
> **Auth**: org:admin OAuth bearer token (`auth_token` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`). Admin API keys are not accepted.

